# data/ is in git (Ishaan, 2026-11-04), except what can't or mustn't go to a public repo:
# - other creators' reels and frames grabbed from them (copyright): data/refs/, data/grabs/
# - source downloads over GitHub's 100 MB limit (re-download from the URL in each SOURCE.md): *.webm except mattes, *.mkv
# - per-frame intermediates rebuilt by the tools (matte/frame PNG folders, candidates)
data/refs/
data/grabs/
data/**/frames/
data/**/matte/
data/**/cand/
data/**/isnet/
data/**/*.webm
!data/**/matte*.webm
data/**/*.mkv
data/clips/ba5c/
# studio runtime (2026-11-05): uploads are visitors' footage, never committed; stock photos keep their own licences
# (credited per edit in spec.card.json) and are re-fetched; demo recordings are large intermediates
data/jobs/
data/stock/
data/clips/raw/
data/demo/rec*/
data/demo/parts/
data/demo/*.jpg
recreate/ba1/data/

